The skills reference third-party tools and skills by name in order to be
concrete about where responsibility sits — for example DeepSeek Harness,
WorkBuddy, CodeWhale, Claude Code, and the companion skills `impeccable` and
`diagram-design`. These references are descriptive and imply no affiliation,
sponsorship, or endorsement. No third-party code is vendored in this
repository.


